📄 Page 3: Campaign Performance Analysis
-------------------------------------------
🎯 Executive Summary & Purpose

The Campaign Performance Analysis report evaluates the effectiveness, efficiency, and overall revenue contribution of marketing initiatives across different channels. 
While promotional campaigns are essential for driving customer acquisition and boosting product demand, tracking their financial ROI is critical. 
This dashboard bridges marketing spend with sales outcomes—enabling business leaders to monitor customer acquisition costs, measure ad efficiency, and strategically allocate budgets toward high-performing campaigns.

📊 Visual Breakdown & Interactive Features

Core Campaign Metrics & MoM Benchmarks (KPI Summary Cards):
----------------------------------------------------------------
Displays headline efficiency and funnel metrics, each paired with its Previous Month (PM) comparison to instantly show growth trends and performance trajectory:

1. Campaign Budget: Tracks total ad expenditure against prior period spend.

2. Total CPC (Cost-Per-Click): Evaluates ad spend efficiency per click.

3. Add-to-Cart %: Measures mid-funnel interest and purchase intent.

4. Conversion %: Quantifies the percentage of ad traffic that completes a purchase.

5. CAC (Customer Acquisition Cost): Tracks the average investment required to acquire a paying customer.

Spend vs. Revenue Attribution (Donut Chart):
-------------------------------------------------
Features a Total Sales vs. Campaign Budget donut chart, giving stakeholders an immediate visual ratio of overall revenue generated compared to total ad investment.

Top Performers & Reference Benchmarks (KPI Cards):
--------------------------------------------------
Highlights top-tier initiatives by surfacing the specific Campaign with the Highest Sales and Campaign with the Highest Customer Acquisition, complete with exact volume and revenue figures for quick baseline referencing.

Platform Comparison & Performance Breakdown (Bar Chart):
----------------------------------------------------------
Utilizes a comparative bar chart to benchmark campaign efficiency (Budget, Conversion %, and ROAS) across different distribution platforms (e.g., Social, Search, Display) to identify high-converting channels.

Granular Campaign Performance Matrix (Matrix Visual):
---------------------------------------------------=
Delivers a comprehensive itemized breakdown for each campaign, detailing Campaign Budget, Conversion %, ROAS %, Total Sales, and Orders Acquired. This allows team leads to evaluate individual campaign outcomes side by side.

Interactive Dynamic Slicers:
----------------------------
1. Metric Picker / Calculation Switcher Slicer: Allows users to dynamically change measure focus across charts and visuals.

2. Category & Agreement Code Slicers: Enables targeted filtering by product category or specific vendor contracts to assess campaign efficiency under different business agreements.

💡 Key Takeaway:
By pairing month-over-month performance benchmarks with platform comparisons and dynamic metric switching, 
this report equips marketing and sales decision-makers with the insights needed to eliminate wasteful ad spend and maximize Return on Ad Spend (ROAS).
